    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/cbc9c803adce8f5c0ed13a7432dee781.webp?t=1648573559\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.poster.avif?t=1648573559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.webm?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.mp4?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Domino Simulator is a physics-based sandbox game in which you place various domino tiles and pieces to construct domino chains. Enjoy the odd satisfaction of watching your creation fall one after the other. Ultimately, the floor is yours to fill and the how and the what is completely up to you. Welcome to the world of domino destruction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.poster.avif?t=1648573559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.webm?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.mp4?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/cbc9c803adce8f5c0ed13a7432dee781.webp?t=1648573559\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.poster.avif?t=1648573559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.webm?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/3f4893270047529de13813c550dc8442.mp4?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Domino Simulator is a physics-based sandbox game in which you place various domino tiles and pieces to construct domino chains. Enjoy the odd satisfaction of watching your creation fall one after the other. Ultimately, the floor is yours to fill and the how and the what is completely up to you. Welcome to the world of domino destruction.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.poster.avif?t=1648573559\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.webm?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1246490/extras/2b8070ec3d0a83a0905dd8ffbdbe0699.mp4?t=1648573559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
